        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Characters: Mildew Wolf, Scooby-Doo\n- People: John Stephenson\n- Companies: Hanna-Barbera\n- Products: Scooby's All-Star Laff-A-Lympics, Scooby-Doo franchise\n- Topics: animated television\n\nFacts:\n- In 1969, Hanna-Barbera created the animated television franchise Scooby-Doo.\n- Scoobert \"Scooby\" Doo is the eponymous character and protagonist of the Scooby-Doo franchise.\n- In 1977, Mildew Wolf became an announcer on \"Scooby's All-Star Laff-A-Lympics.\"\n- John Stephenson voiced Mildew Wolf on \"Scooby's All-Star Laff-A-Lympics.\"",
